{"seq":3,"slug":"api-versioning","title":"API 版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design/api-versioning","wordCount":644,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"api-版本管理\">API 版本管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>API 版本管理解决的核心问题是<strong>变更兼容性</strong>——如何在不破坏现有客户端的前提下演进 API。任何有外部消费者的 API 都会面临这个挑战：一旦发布，API 就是一份契约，单方面违约（破坏性变更）会导致客户端崩溃。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[API 变更] --&gt; B{兼容性评估}&#10;    B --&gt;|向后兼容| C[直接发布]&#10;    B --&gt;|破坏性变更| D{版本策略}&#10;    D --&gt; E[URL 路径版本]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Header 版本]&#10;    D --&gt; G[Query 版本]&#10;    C --&gt; H[通知消费者]&#10;    E --&gt; I[新旧版本并行运行]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[废弃旧版本]&#10;    J --&gt; K[下线旧版本]\">graph TD\n    A[API 变更] --&gt; B{兼容性评估}\n    B --&gt;|向后兼容| C[直接发布]\n    B --&gt;|破坏性变更| D{版本策略}\n    D --&gt; E[URL 路径版本]\n    D --&gt; F[Header 版本]\n    D --&gt; G[Query 版本]\n    C --&gt; H[通知消费者]\n    E --&gt; I[新旧版本并行运行]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[废弃旧版本]\n    J --&gt; K[下线旧版本]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本策略</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>URL 路径</td>\n<td><code>/v1/users</code>, <code>/v2/users</code></td>\n<td>直观、易缓存</td>\n<td>URL 不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 Header</td>\n<td><code>X-API-Version: 2</code></td>\n<td>URL 不变</td>\n<td>不可见、难调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accept Header</td>\n<td><code>Accept: application/vnd.api.v2+json</code></td>\n<td>符合 HTTP 语义</td>\n<td>复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Query 参数</td>\n<td><code>/users?version=2</code></td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>不优雅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期版本</td>\n<td><code>2024-01-15</code></td>\n<td>精确追溯</td>\n<td>版本数量爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"兼容性变更分类\">兼容性变更分类</h2><p>API 变更的兼容性判定是版本管理的基础。需要区分<strong>向后兼容变更</strong>和<strong>破坏性变更</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ChangeClassification {&#10;  type: string;&#10;  backward: &#39;compatible&#39; | &#39;breaking&#39;;&#10;  examples: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const classifications: ChangeClassification[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;新增可选字段&#39;,&#10;    backward: &#39;compatible&#39;,&#10;    examples: [&#39;响应中增加 avatar 字段&#39;, &#39;请求中增加可选的 tag 参数&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;新增端点&#39;,&#10;    backward: &#39;compatible&#39;,&#10;    examples: [&#39;增加 GET /users/:id/preferences&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;删除字段&#39;,&#10;    backward: &#39;breaking&#39;,&#10;    examples: [&#39;删除响应中的 deprecated_field&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;修改字段类型&#39;,&#10;    backward: &#39;breaking&#39;,&#10;    examples: [&#39;id 从 number 变为 string&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;修改必填性&#39;,&#10;    backward: &#39;breaking&#39;,&#10;    examples: [&#39;可选字段变为必填&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;修改语义&#39;,&#10;    backward: &#39;breaking&#39;,&#10;    examples: [&#39;status 值从 &quot;active&quot; 改为 &quot;enabled&quot;&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    type: &#39;新增枚举值&#39;,&#10;    backward: &#39;compatible&#39;,&#10;    examples: [&#39;status 增加 &quot;archived&quot; 值&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChangeClassification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  backward</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'compatible'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'breaking'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  examples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> classifications</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChangeClassification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'新增可选字段'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backward: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'compatible'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    examples: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'响应中增加 avatar 字段'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'请求中增加可选的 tag 参数'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'新增端点'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backward: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'compatible'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    examples: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'增加 GET /users/:id/preferences'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'删除字段'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backward: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'breaking'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    examples: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'删除响应中的 deprecated_field'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'修改字段类型'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backward: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'breaking'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    examples: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id 从 number 变为 string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'修改必填性'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backward: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'breaking'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    examples: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'可选字段变为必填'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'修改语义'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backward: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'breaking'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    examples: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'status 值从 \"active\" 改为 \"enabled\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'新增枚举值'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backward: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'compatible'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    examples: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'status 增加 \"archived\" 值'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>向后兼容变更的黄金法则是：<strong>只增不减，只松不紧</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ 增加新字段（响应或可选请求）</li>\n<li>✅ 增加新端点</li>\n<li>✅ 增加新枚举值</li>\n<li>❌ 删除字段</li>\n<li>❌ 修改字段类型或语义</li>\n<li>❌ 将可选字段改为必填</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"版本实现策略\">版本实现策略</h2><p><strong>URL 路径版本</strong>是最广泛采用的策略。它的最大优势是直观——URL 本身就表达了版本信息，浏览器可以直接访问，缓存代理可以按 URL 区分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Hono } from &#39;hono&#39;;&#10;&#10;const v1 = new Hono();&#10;v1.get(&#39;/users/:id&#39;, async (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const user = await getUser(c.req.param(&#39;id&#39;));&#10;  return c.json({&#10;    id: user.id,&#10;    name: user.name,&#10;    email: user.email,&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;const v2 = new Hono();&#10;v2.get(&#39;/users/:id&#39;, async (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const user = await getUser(c.req.param(&#39;id&#39;));&#10;  return c.json({&#10;    id: user.id,&#10;    displayName: user.name,&#10;    emailAddress: user.email,&#10;    avatar: user.avatarUrl,&#10;    createdAt: user.createdAt.toISOString(),&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;const app = new Hono();&#10;app.route(&#39;/v1&#39;, v1);&#10;app.route(&#39;/v2&#39;, v2);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Hono } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Hono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users/:id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#